ssues/comments/2992265240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107734#issuecomment-2992265240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107734","id":2992265240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yWlgY","user":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T16:58:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T17:04:24Z","body":"> Is this due to the introduction of the stencil buffer functionality that was added? From looking at the console output it appears to be choking on creating shader variants. Did this functionality add more varyings / builtins that may cause custom shaders to break?\n\nMy game did have several custom shaders that messed with albedo and z-depth. these werent ported to godot and were getting called in the shadow pass, which may have caused some issues with the new build.\n\n\n\n> For shaders this is already fixed, see:\n> \n> * [[4.5.beta1] Spatial shader compilation failed when reading NORMAL in light() in Forward+ renderer #107590](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107590)\n\n\nOkay this is actually it i think. I was originally suspicious of thumbnails since their popup didn't even open and no other new features were applied yet.\n\n> [@Fire551](https://github.com/Fire551) Can you make a backup of your 4.4 project and try opening your project with 4.5dev4 and see if it works, instead of the 4.5beta1 ?\n\ntried it in Godot 4.5 dev4 and it didn't crash, which was nice. \ntried it again in Godot 4.5 beta 1 in compatability renderer, and it proceeded to stall and crash on thumbnail creation\ni think this crash is probably related to [107736](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736) though, as well as probably missing paths that crash it or something.\n\nheres the console for the crash in compatability. since idk how to find the damn crash report\n[crash 4.5 beta in compatability renderer.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20840300/crash.4.5.beta.in.compatability.renderer.txt)\n\nI'll consider this completed since this is too vague and is already addressed by other issues. I'll open it back up or create another if the issue persists to the next version","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992265240/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]